{"id":"n-20261013-5u6nbs","category":"sports","display_title":"Opening Round Surprises In Basketball","display_title_he":"הפתעות במחזור הפתיחה בכדורסל","short_summary":"The opening round of the basketball league concluded with unexpected results as Maccabi Ashdod, Maccabi Ramat Gan, and Hapoel Eilat secured opening victories.","english_level":"C1","words":455,"reading_time":3,"image":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/Taylor_Swift_Reputation_Tour_Minneapolis_%2844348645352%29.jpg/960px-Taylor_Swift_Reputation_Tour_Minneapolis_%2844348645352%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Michael Hicks from Saint Paul, MN, USA · CC BY 2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Taylor_Swift_Reputation_Tour_Minneapolis_(44348645352).jpg"},"sources":[{"name":"Walla","domain":"sports.walla.co.il","url":"https://sports.walla.co.il/item/3871955","title":"\"ניצחנו עם הלב\": המפתיעות של מחזור הפתיחה חוגגות","published_at":"2026-10-13T08:54:00.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-13T08:54:00.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-13T07:55:30.434Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":8,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["The opening round of the Israeli Premier League basketball season concluded with three intense matches, delivering notable surprises and strong statements from underdog teams. The biggest upset took place at the HaKiriya Arena in Ashdod, where Maccabi Ashdod triumphed over Ironi Ness Ziona with a score of 76-62. Coached by Dan Katzir, Ashdod pulled away from the orange-clad visitors during the decisive final quarter, fueled by Robert Turner, who recorded an impressive 23 points and 7 rebounds. Katzir praised his squad's defensive effort and tactical discipline, highlighting a crucial 17-0 run that allowed them to seize control of the game despite an offensive performance he noted they would not necessarily want to replicate. He also emphasized the importance of energy from the home crowd and expressed hope for their continued backing in upcoming fixtures. Conversely, Ness Ziona coach Paul Corsaro expressed deep disappointment, pointing out that his team held the lead for barely five minutes against a theoretically inferior opponent and failed to play cohesively or execute the tactical concepts they practice daily.","In another unexpected outcome at the HaYovel Hall, Bnei Herzliya suffered an 89-79 home defeat against Maccabi Ramat Gan. Despite entering the official fixtures following a remarkably complex preparation period plagued by injuries and personal matters—leaving coach Elad Hassin able to count the number of full team training sessions on two or three fingers—Ramat Gan controlled the contest from the outset. Hassin commended his players for leaving their hearts on the floor and playing with discipline, while singling out Lior Carrera for an exceptional performance yielding 19 points in just 23 minutes. Herzliya's coach, Yeho Orland, admitted his side was disjointed, suffered from a weak display by several players including Noah Carter and an inefficient D.J. Brewton, and lacked chemistry following recent roster additions like Lucas Goldenberg and Shoham Gat. Orland hinted that tactical adjustments in player roles might be necessary to stabilize the squad, though he stressed he was not panicking ahead of their upcoming match against Ness Ziona.","Meanwhile, at Beit Maccabi, Hapoel Eilat secured an 89-80 away victory against Hapoel Rishon Lezion. Eilat built a commanding 15-point lead during the first half, weathered a turbulent third-quarter crisis driven by foul trouble and turnovers that allowed Rishon Lezion to temporarily reverse the deficit and lead 73-71 near the end, and ultimately sealed the win with a 9-0 run featuring clutch three-pointers from Israeli players Tzuf Ben Moshe and Daniel Rosenbaum. Eilat coach Oren Aharoni credited his players' character and decisive fourth-quarter execution alongside Kendall McCollum, Brian, and Javonte. On the losing side, Rishon Lezion coach Guy Kaplan noted an overwhelming total of 22 turnovers and a lack of emotional composure during the dying moments that ultimately handed the victory to their opponents."],"facts":[{"fact":"Maccabi Ashdod defeated Ironi Ness Ziona 76-62, led by Robert Turner with 23 points and 7 rebounds.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Maccabi Ramat Gan beat Bnei Herzliya 89-79, with Lior Carrera scoring 19 points in 23 minutes.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Hapoel Eilat defeated Hapoel Rishon Lezion 89-80 after a decisive late run.","sources":[1]}],"glossary":[{"text":"opening","lemma":"opening","pos":"noun","he":"פתיחה","name":false},{"text":"round","lemma":"round","pos":"noun","he":"מחזור","name":false},{"text":"Israeli","lemma":"Israeli","pos":"adjective","he":"ישראלי","name":true},{"text":"Premier League","lemma":"Premier League","pos":"noun","he":"ליגת העל","name":true},{"text":"basketball","lemma":"basketball","pos":"noun","he":"כדורסל","name":false},{"text":"season","lemma":"season","pos":"noun","he":"עונה","name":false},{"text":"concluded","lemma":"conclude","pos":"verb","he":"ננעלו","name":false},{"text":"three","lemma":"three","pos":"number","he":"שלושה","name":false},{"text":"intense","lemma":"intense","pos":"adjective","he":"אינטנסיבי","name":false},{"text":"matches","lemma":"match","pos":"noun","he":"משחקים","name":false},{"text":"delivering","lemma":"deliver","pos":"verb","he":"סיפקו","name":false},{"text":"notable","lemma":"notable","pos":"adjective","he":"בולטות","name":false},{"text":"surprises","lemma":"surprise","pos":"noun","he":"הפתעות","name":false},{"text":"and","lemma":"and","pos":"conjunction","he":"ו","name":false},{"text":"strong","lemma":"strong","pos":"adjective","he":"חזק","name":false},{"text":"statements","lemma":"statement","pos":"noun","he":"הצהרות","name":false},{"text":"from","lemma":"from","pos":"preposition","he":"מ","name":false},{"text":"underdog","lemma":"